If you use this software in a publication, please cite:
  Schwaigert et al., J. Vac. Sci. Technol. A 41, 022703 (2023).

The underlying algorithms originate from Dr. Tassilo Heeg's Delphi XRDC tool
(FZJ/ISG1-IT); this is an independent MATLAB re-implementation.

